      <input id="coName" value="Snaptime Photobooth">
      <label>Alamat</label>
      <textarea id="coAddr" rows="4">Jl. Ngalangan Raya No.24,
Jetisbaran, Sardonoharjo, Ngaglik,
Sleman, Daerah Istimewa
Yogyakarta</textarea>
      <label>Payment via Transfer</label>
      <textarea id="bank" rows="4">BNI a/n Hikmat Sejati (1787798131)
BCA a/n Hikmat Sejati (6975678681)
Seabank a/n Hikmat Sejati (901888163712)</textarea>
      <label>Terms & Condition (satu baris = satu poin)</label>
      <textarea id="tnc" rows="7">Pelunasan dilakukan maksimal hari H acara berlangsung
Pihak Snaptime wajib memberikan jasa photo booth.
Apabila waktu telah melampaui batas kesepakatan yang ditetapkan, maka pihak Snaptime berhak untuk menghentikan pelayanan.
Transaksi yang telah dilakukan bersifat final dan tidak dapat dibatalkan dengan alasan apa pun.</textarea>
      <div class="row">
        <div><label>Kota tanda tangan</label><input id="city" value="Yogyakarta"></div>
        <div><label>Nama penandatangan</label><input id="signer" value="Hikmat Sejati"></div>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>

  <!-- ===== PREVIEW ===== -->
  <div class="stage">
    <div id="sheet">
      <div class="head">
        <div>
          <h1>INVOICE</h1>
          <div class="co-name" id="p-coName"></div>
          <div class="co-addr" id="p-coAddr"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="logo-box" id="p-logo"></div>
      </div>
      <hr class="rule">
      <div class="to">
        <h4>Invoice To:</h4>
        <div id="p-to" style="margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10.5pt"></div>
        <table class="meta">
          <tr><td>Invoice Number</td><td>: <span id="p-num"></span></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Invoice Date</td><td>: <span id="p-date"></span></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Due Date</td><td>: <span id="p-due"></span></td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>

      <table class="items">
        <thead><tr><th style="width:46%">Description</th><th class="c" style="width:10%">Qty</th><th class="r" style="width:20%">Price</th><th class="r">Ammount</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody id="p-rows"></tbody>
        <tfoot>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="2" rowspan="4" class="pay"><h5>Payment Via Transfer</h5><div id="p-bank"></div></td>
            <td class="r sl">Discount</td><td class="r" id="p-disc"></td>
          </tr>
          <tr><td class="r sl">Total</td><td class="r" id="p-total"></td></tr>
          <tr><td class="r sl">Down Payment</td><td class="r" id="p-dp"></td></tr>
          <tr class="due"><td class="r sl">Amount Date</td><td class="r" id="p-due-amt"></td></tr>
        </tfoot>
